# React toolchain for the save-the-date (see app/). The BUILD OUTPUT is
# committed on purpose — GitHub Pages serves this repo's root directly, so
# save-the-date.html and assets/std/ have to be in the tree. dist/ is only
# the staging area scripts/postbuild.mjs copies out of.
node_modules/
dist/

